                                                "sense_id": "0d8733b3-946c-3580-a07b-0f4c9801a1cc",
                                                "text": "You can download Google's deskbar for free […] It automatically installs itself as a toolbar on the Windows XP taskbar, but you have to turn it on by right-clicking the taskbar and choosing Toolbars → Google Deskbar."
